Fri Oct 16 06:05:39 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.13.0:
  * Add support for Python 3.15, PyPy 3.12 and GraalPy 3.13;
    drop support for Python 3.10
  * Add support for built-in frozendict
  * Add ormsgpack.Fragment to embed pre-serialized MessagePack
    in packb output without re-serializing
  * Fix memory leak when unpackb fails on malformed or truncated
    arrays or maps
  * Fix serialization of numpy.datetime64 values before the Unix
    epoch; reject NaT and out-of-range values

